摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Same-process session-to-session messaging plugin for DeepSeek Harness","id":"gh:1335781534","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-bridge","slug":"baixianger/dsh-bridge","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Same-process session-to-session messaging plugin for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Bridge"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-bridge) [](LICENSE) [](https://github.com/topics/dsh-plugin)"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Let sessions in one DeepSeek Harness host discover each other and exchange messages. Bridge is the l"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ocal foundation beneath Chat rooms and trusted Weave delivery."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Three tools, one local host"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| Tool | Purpose |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| `session_list` | Discover sessions and their current state. |\n| `session_send` | Send by exact ses"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"sion ID or human-readable title. |\n| `session_messages` | Read a bounded recent delivery log. |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Ask an agent to list sessions, then send a message to the intended session. Bridge adds tools direct"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"ly; it has no separate settings page."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"For `session_send`, `mode: auto` tries the ID before the title; `id` and `name` select one lookup me"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"thod. Titles match case-insensitively. Ambiguous names return candidate IDs instead of choosing a re"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"ch case-insensitively. Ambiguous names return candidate IDs instead of choosing a recipient for you."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Delivery that respects session state"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- Idle agents wake; running agents receive queued work.\n- Persisted sessions resume with their recor"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ded preset and model.\n- Concurrent requests to a cold session share one resume operation.\n- Archived"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" sessions reject delivery and are not woken.\n- Cancelling during a cold resume prevents a late follo"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"w-up, even if the shared load finishes."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"A delivery acknowledgement means the session accepted the follow-up. It does not mean the model has "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"processed it or completed the task."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Field | Default | Purpose |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| `recentMessages` | `1000` | Retained messages per host. |\n| `dedupeCapacity` | `10000` | Remembere"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"d external message IDs. |\n| `maxMessagesPerRead` | `100` | Maximum messages returned per read. |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Plugin integration"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"`ctx.dshBridge` is the public service. Trusted transports call `deliverExternal()` so local and exte"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"rnal delivery share the same follow-up and audit path. Its optional `signal` carries cancellation th"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"rough session resolution."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"DSH Weave supplies cross-host transport; DSH Chat supplies rooms and a Web conversation view. Neithe"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"r is required for local messaging."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Retention & boundaries"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Bridge operates within one host process. Its recent-message log and duplicate-ID table live in memor"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"y and reset on plugin unload or reload; they are not a durable mailbox. The old `ctx.sessionMessagin"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"g` accessor remains a temporary compatibility alias."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Development & feedback"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Report an issue · Release notes · MIT license"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
